        <target state="translated">你在弹窗中对这条连接作出了选择。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainPromptTimeout">
      <segment>
        <source>The prompt was not answered in time, so the default action was applied.</source>
        <target state="translated">弹窗在限定时间内没有得到回应，按默认动作处理。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainBuiltin">
      <segment>
        <source>Essential system traffic (such as DHCP and DNS) is always allowed.</source>
        <target state="translated">系统必需的流量（如 DHCP、DNS）始终放行。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainNoUserSession">
      <segment>
        <source>No signed-in user could be asked, so the default action was applied.</source>
        <target state="translated">没有可以询问的已登录用户，按默认动作处理。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainDoNotDisturb">
      <segment>
        <source>Do not disturb was on, so no prompt was shown and the default action was applied.</source>
        <target state="translated">勿扰模式开启，没有弹窗，按默认动作处理。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainFailSafe">
      <segment>
        <source>An internal error occurred, so the fail policy decided.</source>
        <target state="translated">内部出错，按失效策略处理。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExplainCancelled">
      <segment>
